  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to facilitate sustainability science, education for sustainable development and capacity building, and provide stakeholders including youth with knowledge, skills, values and attitudes matching climate change response, including carbon footprint reduction, ecological protection and biodiversity conservation through &quot;hand-in-hand action&quot;, &quot;forest protection action&quot;, &quot;partnership action&quot; and &quot; practical education base action&quot; with the purpose to promote the practical action of ecological civilization and build a sustainable future for all.</narrative>
